--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: edges::mixin
visibility: public
--- !node &Alpha
pub port: 1
--- !node &Beta
pub port: 2
# An **untagged** mixin — D7.1's ordinary form — declaring the endpoints once.
# It carries no tag saying "edge", because there is no such tag to carry: the
# abstract counterpart of a concrete node is whatever the author wrote, and
# most of them write nothing.
--- &Mixin
pub connections: [Alpha]
pub definition:
  only: 0
# The same case with a tag that says nothing about edges either.
--- !node &Tagged
pub connections: [Alpha, Beta]
--- !edge &FromMixin
extends: Mixin
--- !edge &FromNode
extends: Tagged
# Inclusion absorbs the member the same way, so it reaches the same items.
--- &Included
pub connections: [Beta]
--- !edge &Includes
<<: Included
